Indigo's change: faults a test can ask the SD card for, to see what a program
does with a failing card. DOLPHIN_SD_FAULTS, comma separated:
read-error=FIRST-LAST and write-error=FIRST-LAST (sector ranges), and
write-error-after=N (every write once N have succeeded). A write the card
could not make is answered with the write error data response (0x0D), where
0001 answered "accepted" whatever happened. GNU General Public License
version 2 or later, as Dolphin.

